@page "/"

<PageTitle>HyperCache</PageTitle>

<h1 class="text-primary">HyperCache</h1>

<p class="lead">
    A demo of HTTP caching with the <a href="https://github.com/SimonCropp/Delta" target="_blank">Delta</a> middleware
    on .NET 10, Entity Framework Core 10 and SQL Server.
</p>

<p>
    The API behind this page holds one million rows. Every <code>GET</code> carries an <code>ETag</code> derived from
    the database's change stamp, so repeating a request costs a <code>304 Not Modified</code> instead of a query.
    Open the browser's network tab, page back and forth, and watch the repeat requests come back in milliseconds.
</p>

